WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.560
Hi, I'm Michael from Commercial Floorcoverings Australia. We supply and install commercial

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:12.040
flooring. Before engaging the team, quoting was the thing that was holding us back. Every

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:19.520
quote took real time and effort and honestly it kept us tied to Sydney area. I worked

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:24.360
with the team because they took the time to understand how we actually quote a flooring

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:32.040
job and built a system around how we work and the system was really good for us because

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:41.800
it was tailor made for my business. They built us a quoting system that turned out very

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.600
fast compared to what we were using before. The big one for us, it meant that we can

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:51.720
put together an accurate quote from anywhere, not just for the jobs on our doorstep.

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:56.800
That's what opened the door for us, taking work right across the country. Andy was there

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:02.200
the whole step of the way and treated his business, my business, like his own. We've

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.600
gone from a Sydney business to quoting and winning flooring jobs all around Australia.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:13.900
The quoting used to hold us back now is what lets us grow. It was worth it no doubt

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:20.160
because now we can go anywhere within Australia and do quotes, not just on the doorstep.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:27.640
This enables us to take on other work in Australia and eventually overseas so we can expand our business.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:33.200
It was worth it because now we can expand, go national, go international because we've

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:38.120
got a system and we've got an IT guy that's there to work with us and make it better.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:44.480
What do I recommend Andy to anyone in the flooring industry? Of course I would. His app

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:48.360
has saved me a lot of time, a lot of money and it's gone the extra mile and it helped

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:53.680
my business extremely well and I really wish Andy could meet other people in the industry

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.080
and make their lives a lot better. Thanks Andy.

